govenv-project-purpose-snapshot-v2
review-index 2
review-rationale "GV123 now makes the learning gate operationally reachable from zero through governed prompts, exact human-response capture, and debt-reducing evidence-only pull requests; this strengthens the existing human-authority purpose without changing it."
purpose "Turn every repository into a self-governing developer environment: define what valid means once, let agents move fast without outrunning human authority, and reproduce the same tooling, automation, and runtime anywhere."
